WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.167
-Thank you very much, everybody. Thank you.

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:05.200
Welcome, welcome, welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.400
You're here.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:11.100
Hey, guys, I'm excited about this.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.968
The director and star of "Creed III,"

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:16.000
Michael B. Jordan, is here tonight.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:20.400
♪♪

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.033
When I saw him backstage, I thought, "Oh, so that's what

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.033
sticking to your new year's resolution looks like."

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:26.901
You're like, "Oh, yeah..."

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:29.200
Let's get to some news. Everyone's talking about this.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.801
After a two-year suspension,

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:33.567
Meta is reinstating former President Trump's

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:35.968
Facebook and Instagram accounts.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.868
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:38.868 --> 00:00:41.567
Trump hasn't been on Facebook for two years.

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:44.033
So, pretty much just like the rest of us.

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:45.667
Uh...

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:47.033
I forgot all about it.

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:48.534
It's a big day for Trump.

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:50.334
He hasn't been this excited since they found documents

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:51.934
at Biden and Pence's house.

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:54.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:55.701
Trump was like, "Thank God.

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:57.868
It's been years since I've gotten to poke someone."

00:00:57.868 --> 00:01:00.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:03.167
Speaking of Trump, I read that after years of avoiding it,

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:06.267
he finally started sending text messages.

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:08.000
Yeah, until now, Trump didn't text.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.634
And he's starting to get into it,

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:12.067
but he's still figuring out how emojis work.

00:01:12.067 --> 00:01:13.567
I'll show you what I mean.

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:16.033
For instance, Trump thinks this emoji means

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:18.067
someone's trying to drink a small cup of water.

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:20.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:28.100
Next up, Trump thinks this emoji means the McRib is back.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:33.334
Next up, he thinks this one means selfie.

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:34.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:37.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.868 --> 00:01:40.968
"That's not selfie?"

00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:43.067
Next up, he thinks this one means

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:44.934
that Don Jr. wants to FaceTime.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:47.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.767 --> 00:01:49.701
Next up, he thinks this one means

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:52.100
I'm busy making a very important decision.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:55.934
Next up, he thinks this one means

00:01:55.934 --> 00:01:57.601
date night with Stormy Daniels.

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:59.133
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:01:59.133 --> 00:02:00.567
-Ohh! -Hey. What?

00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:02.334
♪♪

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:04.334
-♪ Mushroom ♪ -And finally, he thinks this one

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:07.234
means when DeSantis announces he's running for president.

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:08.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:11.634
He's getting the hang of it.

00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:13.234
Some news from Washington.

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:15.167
A bill was just introduced in Congress

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:17.701
