00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:19.534
[ Audience oohs ] Good idea.

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:21.868
Without TikTok, the only way China can spy on us

00:02:21.868 --> 00:02:25.534
is through our phones, fridges, and smart toasters.

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:27.634
Yeah, they want to ban TikTok.

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:29.300
Gen Z is like, "You'll have to pry it

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:32.567
from our cold dead tortillas."

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:34.133
I'm sure Biden is all over this.

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:37.267
A week ago, he thought TikTok was a breath mint.

00:02:37.267 --> 00:02:40.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.801 --> 00:02:43.634
[as Pres. Biden] "I once choked on a TikTok."

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:46.968
That's right. There's a new bill to ban TikTok.

00:02:46.968 --> 00:02:49.868
I actually read the whole thing, and I highlighted some sections

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:51.567
I thought were pretty interesting.

00:02:51.567 --> 00:02:52.834
Here. Check this out right here.

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:54.167
Oh, yeah. This one right here.

00:02:54.167 --> 00:02:56.267
In this section, it says...

00:03:00.901 --> 00:03:02.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.734
-Wow. -No cap on that.

00:03:05.734 --> 00:03:08.634
This next section here, this one says...

00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:17.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.100
Look at this next part here. This says...

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.601
Stunning. Stunning.

00:03:29.601 --> 00:03:32.100
This one -- I can't even believe this one is real.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.701
This one says...

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.100
That's not fair. -Wow.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.267
-It's not their fault.

00:03:41.267 --> 00:03:43.901
Look at this one here. This one says...

00:03:48.367 --> 00:03:50.167
[ Applause ]

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:51.534
[ Laughs ]

00:03:51.534 --> 00:03:54.167
