00:03:58.968 --> 00:04:00.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:01.801
It's cake!

00:04:01.801 --> 00:04:04.567
It's just -- Trust me, it's cake.

00:04:04.567 --> 00:04:07.334
And finally they wrapped things up over here by saying...

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:17.868
[ Applause ]

00:04:17.868 --> 00:04:19.200
Guys, get this.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.434
Congressman George Santos is trying to get reporters

00:04:21.434 --> 00:04:23.868
