00:04:25.834 --> 00:04:28.234
This is real. Take a look at this video.

00:04:32.801 --> 00:04:35.601
Yeah. [ Laughter ]

00:04:35.601 --> 00:04:37.801
He was like, "Enjoy. I made it myself."

00:04:37.801 --> 00:04:39.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.234 --> 00:04:45.033
Of course, when they opened the Chick-fil-A bag, it was Arby's.

00:04:45.033 --> 00:04:47.601
