00:04:47.601 --> 00:04:49.467
Well, as we've mentioned all week,

00:04:49.467 --> 00:04:51.734
the price of eggs has skyrocketed recently,

00:04:51.734 --> 00:04:54.534
and it's gotten so bad that Democratic Senator Jack Reed

00:04:54.534 --> 00:04:58.000
