"Walk" sounds like "guac."

00:07:24.501 --> 00:07:27.934
-Uh, I can always spot a new worker at Chipotle.

00:07:27.934 --> 00:07:30.133
Because when you put soda into a water cup,

00:07:30.133 --> 00:07:32.801
