00:07:50.534 --> 00:07:52.667
You know? You just go... [ Audience groans ]

00:07:52.667 --> 00:07:54.000
It's upsetting.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.601
-Oh. Whoa!

00:07:55.601 --> 00:07:56.968
-Well, this is cool.

00:07:56.968 --> 00:07:58.434
It was just announced that JFK Airport

00:07:58.434 --> 00:08:01.734
