00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.767
[ Laughter ]

00:08:10.767 --> 00:08:12.934
Well, listen to this. According to TikTok,

00:08:12.934 --> 00:08:14.234
there's a new dating trend

00:08:14.234 --> 00:08:15.601
